OlivineCity_Area1_Text_Sailor_1::
	.string "I’m sorry. The service is\n"
	.string "currently unavailable.\p"
	.string "We’ve heard the S.S.AQUA had some\n"
	.string "problems on the trip to VERMILION.$"

OlivineCity_Area1_Text_Sailor_2::
	.string "We don’t want you to fall into the\n"
	.string "sea, so you’re not allowed in.$"

OlivineCity_Area1_Text_Sailor_3::
	.string "I’m sorry, but right now there\n"
	.string "is no ship at this port.\p"
	.string "One should be coming in a few\n"
	.string "minutes...$"

OlivineCity_Area1_Text_Sailor_4::
	.string "Welcome to FAST SHIP S.S.AQUA.\p"
	.string "Will you be boarding today?$"

OlivineCity_Area1_Text_Sailor_5::
	.string "We hope to see you again!$"

OlivineCity_Area1_Text_Sailor_6::
	.string "May I see your S.S.TICKET, sir?\p"
	.string "{PLAYER} flashed the S.S.TICKET.\p"
	.string "That’s it.\n"
	.string "Thank you, sir!$"

OlivineCity_Area1_Text_Sailor_7::
	.string "We’re departing soon. Please get\n"
	.string "on board.$"

OlivineCity_Area1_Text_Fisher::
	.string "SHELLDER are easy to catch here.\n"
	.string "They’re kind of rare elsewhere.$"

OlivineCity_Area1_Text_Fisher2::
	.string "How many RODS do you have?\p"
	.string "Different RODS catch different\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

OlivineCity_Area1_Text_Sailor2::
	.string "Sorry. You can’t board now.$"
